<view class="page plans"><view class="eyebrow">YOUR LONG-TERM GOALS</view><view class="headline">为未来，留一份<br/><text>从容的底气</text></view><view wx:if="{{plans.length}}"><block wx:for="{{plans}}" wx:key="id"><view class="card plan"><view><text>{{item.name}}</text><text>{{item.updated}} · 本地保存</text></view><view><text class="serif">¥{{item.monthlyDividend}}</text><text>预计月均分红</text></view><text class="delete" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove">删除</text></view></block></view><view wx:else class="empty card"><text>还没有保存的计划</text><text>从一次测算开始，看见未来的现金流。</text></view><button class="primary-btn" bindtap="start">新建目标计划</button></view>
